# Public publish surface: HTML only.
# Ignore everything by default, then whitelist what GitHub Pages / public viewers need.

*

# Keep directory traversal for whitelist paths
!**/

# Repo essentials
!.gitignore
!index.html
!README.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.*

# Published unit pages
!examples/
!examples/insulet/
!examples/insulet/html/
!examples/insulet/html/**

# Never commit secrets or local tooling even if added later
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.local
